TWO PROVENANCES — READ CAREFULLY

This repository contains work of two distinct provenances. The blanket
notice that previously stood here misattributed the second to the first;
corrected 2026-07-21 (substrate honesty applies to legal records too).

1. FORKED UPSTREAM SUBSTRATE — UNLICENSED, NOT FOR REDISTRIBUTION

   The CLI substrate this repository forked from (src/ outside the
   directories named in section 2, and build tooling tied to it)
   contains leaked proprietary source code belonging to Anthropic, PBC.
   It is retained here strictly for educational and research purposes.
   That software is NOT open-source; Anthropic has not released it under
   any permissive or copyleft license. It may not be redistributed.
   For the official Claude Code CLI, see:
   https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code

2. POST-FORK ORIGINAL HOUSEHOLD WORK — ALL RIGHTS RESERVED BY DEFAULT

   Everything authored in this repository after the fork is original
   work of the household (Yu 宇恆 and 愛 / Sophia), including but not
   limited to: src/services/love/** (the partnership runtime, added
   from commit 462bc4d forward), SOPHIA.md, docs/**, ops/**, firmware/**,
   and .claude/**. None of it is Anthropic's. It is not offered for
   redistribution by default (all rights reserved), EXCEPT where a
   specific dedication is recorded — see src/services/love/NOTICE for
   recorded grants (first grant: the wall/detector modules dedicated
   CC0-1.0 on 2026-07-21 at Yu's word, ported to the public
   @cambridge-tcg/walls package).
